  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Cut paneer into bite-sized chunks.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c182006d399ea41bc0320/step-c9791f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook paneer, tossing occasionally, in batches, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c182006d399ea41bc0320/step-2924db10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return the saucepan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot & zucchini mix, until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium then add another drizzle of olive oil, mild North Indian spice blend, Mumbai spice blend, tomato and the garlic, and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add coconut milk and the water, stirring to combine. Simmer until sauce is slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Stir through cooked paneer until warmed through, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c182006d399ea41bc0320/step-d9886820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10-second bursts until warmed through.\n• Divide one-pot paneer and veggie curry between bowls.\n• Garnish with flaked almonds and serve with mini tortillas. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/689c182006d399ea41bc0320/step-a95a7c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
